  "description": "<h3>Description</h3>\n<p><span>The Ice Nino Down sleeping bag is the ideal overnight companion for smaller-framed adventurers. Known as the younger brother of the Ice Breaker sleeping bag, the Ice Nino is versatile, durable and designed to last a lifetime. Comfort rated at 1°C, and Comfort Limit at -5°C, this bag will keep you insulated and safe. </span></p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>92/8 (600g) Responsibly Sourced Down filling<br>\n</li>\n<li>Chest baffle to prevent cold at the chest<br>\n</li>\n<li>Face baffle for extra comfort and warmth<br>\n</li>\n<li>Foot-friendly zipper system<br>\n</li>\n<li>Internal pocket for valuables<br>\n</li>\n<li>Made from Microtex R/S outside and Microtex 5000 inside</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Weight: 1.3 kg</li>\n<li>Comfort Temperature Rating<span>: 1</span>°C</li>\n<li>Lower Limit Temperature Rating<span>: </span>-5°C</li>\n<li>Extreme Temperature Rating<span>: </span>-22°C</li>\n<li>Dimensions<span>: 1</span>90 X 80 / 52 cm</li>\n<li>Packed Size<span>: </span>18 x 35 cm</li>\n<li>Down Ratio: 92/8</li>\n<li>Fill Power<span>: </span>650</li>\n<li>Material(s): Microtex R/S (Outer) and Microtex 5000 (Inner)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>",
